  "output": "out",
  "coordinate_contract": "Blobs live in the proxy box's object space (-1..1). The vertex stage passes the object-to-world affine map (origin and axes through TDDeform, so Geometry COMP, parent and instance transforms are included). Rays march in object space; normals go to world space with the inverse transpose; refraction, fresnel and lighting are in world space. Depth = (camProj * P).z / w, 0..1 (TouchDesigner proj is Vulkan style). Screen UV from gl_FragCoord and uTDGeneral.viewport (v up); screen shifts are projected with camProj and turned into screen UV directions by screenSign, measured per pixel by comparing the pixel's own projected position with its raster position from gl_FragCoord (on the centre line of an odd-sized render, the sign of dFdx/dFdy taken at the top of main() decides where the face is not edge-on), so neither a projection flip nor a raster that runs the other way can reverse them. Flip V flips the screen UV and the measured vertical sign together, for a Refraction TOP that arrives upside down.",
  "color_contract": "Colour parameters are artistic values. Inputs > Colour parameters (Auto, As typed, sRGB) decides whether the shader converts glass, light, rim and reflection colours from sRGB to linear (presets.decode_colours(); Auto follows the project's working colour space, which is a native check). Output is premultiplied alpha; the material blends with One / One Minus Source Alpha. Colour is capped at 1024 before TDOutputSwizzle (16-bit float targets). The layout TOP is data (32-bit float, nearest), never a display image. Every Render TOP in the recipe has Dither off; no shader adds per-pixel noise.",
  "target_build": "Inspect host; written for TouchDesigner 2025.x (GLSL 4.60), not yet run natively",
  "external_dependencies": [],
  "native_status": "pending: not compiled or rendered in TouchDesigner yet; see validation.json",
  "core_study_commit": "6a58487 (family sync of core audit rounds 2 and 3; first forked at a6f95c6)"
